/ActualText (Product Designer with 4+ years of experience designing complex SaaS platforms, AI-powered applications, ERP systems, and enterprise workflow products. Experienced in owning product design from discovery to delivery, including user research, competitive analysis, requirements gathering, UX architecture, feature planning, interactive prototyping, stakeholder collaboration, developer handoff, and design QA/UAT.\nWith a strong Computer Science background, I work closely with product teams, engineers, and international clients across the US, Europe, and Asia to turn complex business requirements into intuitive, scalable digital products. Passionate about simplifying complex workflows, solving real user problems, and creating design systems that improve usability, efficiency, and product adoption.)
